Poster"},{"data":[{"items":[],"id":18852,"title":"","description":"0","card_type":"comments","type":"comments","url":"","style":null,"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Crime","Mystery","Detective","Suspense"],"id":18852,"type":"SERIES","title":"A Corpse is Buried Under Sakurako’s Feet","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk49/seasons/c22d70ef-4c07-434a-b752-b2b6c0e71d0b.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk54/seasons/5195706b-a544-46b5-bc08-fe30b76a4523.png","likes":14,"dislikes":0,"views":3209,"release_date":"1492905600000","season_number":1,"description":"When Shoutarou Tatewaki first meets Sakurako Kujou, he knows his life will never be the same. Initially believing her to be responsible for a disappearance in the neighborhood, he later learns of her true talent: analyzing bone specimens. Sakurako has quite the collection of reconstructed animal bones, but she wishes she had more of the human variety, much to the chagrin of those around her. Soon, Shoutarou begins accompanying the eccentric osteologist on the many different unsolved cases she comes across—usually in the form of decomposing bodies. But with so many incidents happening around them, could there be a larger mystery at work in their lives?","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8}],"value":8,"age":"PG-13"},"current_season_id":7239,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}